abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Hydro-CTGSSM, a continuous-time graph
  state-space model for sparse river-water-quality monitoring networks, together
  with the frozen evaluation metrics, the station-to-reach matching artefacts,
  and the supplementary data tables accompanying the Water Research submission.
